<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cequipment</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cequipment
</pre>
<p>Lists the equipment in your clan's secret storage, the clan chest, and 
how many items it holds. Any member of the clan can look, but only at the 
clan chest in the clan house.
</p><p>Any member can put things in with <a cmd='#'>Help Cstore</a>; only the clan Master and 
the quartermasters can take them out again (see <a cmd='#'>Help Cunstore</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cstore</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cunstore</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>